WEBVTT

00:00:00.611 --> 00:00:02.054
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> …the teacher turned round and said to me,

00:00:02.082 --> 00:00:04.907
‘You are lazy and stupid and you’ll never make anything of your life’.

00:00:05.456 --> 00:00:07.505
I don’t blame her, you know, what she was

00:00:07.530 --> 00:00:10.797
– she was dealing with a situation at the time, but I knew I was neither…